# B-08/B-09 revision test baseline (read-only)

Owner-authorised UI revision of 2026-10-17 (docs/decisions.md B-08 and B-09):
searchable vehicle dropdown over the session location's registry, one-off new
vehicle entry, and the full visual restyle.

This file records the **revised** acceptance baseline. It is a documented
planner correction, not an implementer edit of history:

- `apps/tablet/src/__tests__/pre-issuance-entry.test.tsx` — the ENT-02
  no-request-below-three-characters case now distinguishes the dropdown's
  open/click list request (empty `q`, B-08) from a typed search; the retry case
  separates the list request from the search request; two new cases cover the
  list-on-open and the one-off new-vehicle flow (provenance null). No assertion
  was weakened or removed.
- `apps/api/tests/integration/pre-issuance.test.ts` — the empty-query 400 case
  is now the B-08 list-mode case (200, scoped, registration-ordered); one- and
  two-character searches still assert 400 `invalid_request`.
- `apps/tablet/e2e/pre-issuance.spec.ts` — the three pre-existing journeys are
  untouched; two new journeys cover the scoped dropdown and the one-off new
  vehicle.
- `apps/tablet/vitest.config.ts` — `testTimeout` raised to 15s because the
  dropdown renders per debounced keystroke in jsdom; every assertion is intact.
- `packages/contracts/src/preIssuance.ts` — contract for the list mode
  (optional/empty `query`, `REGISTRY_LIST_LIMIT`); the non-empty three-character
  minimum is unchanged.
- `tests/e2e/api-proxy.spec.ts` and `apps/tablet/e2e/camera-signature.spec.ts`
  are recorded unchanged for traceability.
- `apps/tablet/e2e/preview-binding.spec.ts` and
  `apps/tablet/e2e/signature-probe.spec.ts` (page-completion pass, same day):
  the redesigned capture step's viewfinder is taller, so the signature canvas
  can start below the 720px fold; both probes now call
  `scrollIntoViewIfNeeded()` before measuring raw mouse geometry, exactly as a
  human signer would. No assertion was changed.

Verification on the frozen state (2026-10-17): format check, lint, typecheck,
unit suites (42 + 101 + 14 + 69), integration 103, e2e 38, build, tablet-size
149348 B gzip (threshold 250000) — all pass.

Independent review of this revision remains required; nothing here is a review
approval.

